    "updated_at": "2016-09-02T04:55:51Z",
    "body": "Yes, I know it's unclear.  But apparently Microsoft doesn't want to talk about it and we can just examine the code for WebKit and Blink so their not talking about it is not really a hindrance except insofar as we don't know what they're willing to implement.  At some point we just need to make a call....  We can make it as part of the spec, or I can make it as part of Gecko's code, I guess.  In the end it's all the same if the other browser vendors refuse to talk to us.  :(\n",
