    "updated_at": "2016-09-07T02:49:21Z",
    "body": "It's unfortunate because it will actually use whatever garbage might be in the XML declaration even if it has nothing to do with encoding.  I agree that sniffing XML declarations is already unfortunate, but it seems worthwhile to me to minimize the badness if we can.  And Edge seems like an existence proof that we can, to me...\n",
