    "body": "In WebKit/Blink the sniffing of XML decl is only in the \"prescan a byte stream to determine its encoding\" (spec term), not in the actual parser, right? The spec currently makes the prescan optional. Should we make it not optional? Or add a new kind of token in the parser?\n",
