    "body": "> https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/#change-the-encoding\n\nBroken link.  I assume you meant https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/syntax.html#change-the-encoding\n\nThis will renavigate in UAs in practice.  It's there as a \"get out of jail free card\" for various insane behavior browsers used to have, but in practice we want to do all the encoding detection in the prescan.\n\n@domenic in XML, leading whitespace before the XML decl is not allowed, so there is no reason to ignore leading whitespace when looking for `<?xml`\n",
